linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

Splendid, splendid～! Laugh in the face of this
fleeting world where death comes for all;
throw those 108 kleshas out the window!

Look no further than this fool here it produced,
with #[his][her]# lack of boundaries;
adolescence written all over.

That's neither for you nor me to decide;
only for the one fool who made it all
the way here to.

This is the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF;
silent as a still night and garnished with twirling
cherry blossom petals;
#C236196003BB#CDEF's world.

Even if the means to do so wasn't justified;
even if the person she sought to protect ended
up hating her―she made it happen.

A woman overflowing with love, mad with love;
delighted to welcome any immorality and tainted
by a breadth of desires.

Even if it's dim and not worth the bother;
illusory. …one can see it, warm within
the last lamp.
